    "description": "LOGISTEC provides marine cargo handling, port services, transportation logistics, and environmental remediation services in Canada and the United States. Its customers include port users, industrial shippers, infrastructure owners, and public-sector counterparties that require recurring essential-services support. The business combines asset-backed terminal operations with service-led environmental activities, producing a diversified infrastructure-services profile rather than a single-asset concession model. Public materials describe a broad network of marine terminals and environmental service operations across North America. Blue Wolf Capital Partners agreed to acquire the company in 2023, and Stonepeak partnered in the transaction by providing significant investment support that closed in January 2024.",
